WEBVTT

00:07:58.156 --> 00:08:02.036
So participants interacting
with our humanlike bots

00:08:02.076 --> 00:08:05.716
were more concerned
about social evaluation

00:08:05.756 --> 00:08:08.236
and as a result of this
social apprehension,

00:08:08.236 --> 00:08:13.316
they also gave more
socially desirable responses.

00:08:13.316 --> 00:08:15.276
Let me give you an example.

00:08:15.276 --> 00:08:18.956
One of the most delicate questions
that we asked participants

00:08:18.996 --> 00:08:22.316
was the number of prior
sex partners they had had.

00:08:23.276 --> 00:08:26.436
When interacting with our humanlike bot,

00:08:26.436 --> 00:08:31.356
men reported to have
significantly more prior sex partners